1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,386
Two AI agents, two branches.

2
00:00:01,386 --> 00:00:02,773
Both are green against main.

3
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:06,622
But both rewrite the same lines of auth.ts.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:09,178
Git only finds out at merge.

5
00:00:09,178 --> 00:00:10,602
One lands, and the other breaks.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,327
Bullpen stops it before it happens.

7
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:15,961
You type one ask.

8
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:19,233
Three Claude Code agents start work,

9
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:20,170
each on its own branch.

10
00:00:21,467 --> 00:00:22,849
Two of them want the same file.

11
00:00:22,849 --> 00:00:23,652
One gets the lock.

12
00:00:24,967 --> 00:00:25,805
The other waits in line,

13
00:00:25,805 --> 00:00:26,714
so nothing is overwritten.

14
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,374
A guarded folder needs a human.

15
00:00:29,374 --> 00:00:30,749
Bullpen shows an approval card.

16
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:33,021
Deny it, and the agent

17
00:00:33,021 --> 00:00:34,008
writes a plan instead.

18
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,755
Don't like one agent's work?

19
00:00:36,755 --> 00:00:37,587
Undo that agent.

20
00:00:37,587 --> 00:00:38,990
Only its branch rolls back.

21
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:40,979
Happy with another?

22
00:00:40,979 --> 00:00:41,766
Merge it to main.

23
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:44,997
The other branches sync with it at once.

24
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,092
Every edit is checked by a referee,

25
00:00:48,092 --> 00:00:49,843
on separate hardware the agents can't touch.

26
00:00:51,133 --> 00:00:53,234
Pause the referee, and every edit is denied.

27
00:00:53,234 --> 00:00:53,999
It fails closed.

28
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,823
And every edit is a commit, tagged

29
00:00:56,823 --> 00:00:58,077
with the agent that made it.

30
00:00:59,367 --> 00:01:00,420
Git tracks what changed.

31
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,352
Bullpen controls who's allowed to change it.
